{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4901037590010","name":"透","text":"────ねー\r\n帰る？","trans":"────呐\n回去吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……え？\r\nああ────","trans":"……诶？\n啊啊────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901037590020","name":"透","text":"まっすぐ？","trans":"直接回去？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────え？　ええと……そうだな\r\nコンビニとかは寄って────","trans":"────诶？　那个……是啊\n会去趟便利店之类的────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901037590030","name":"透","text":"とか？　って？","trans":"之类的？　你是说？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────……\r\nいや、コンビニ寄るくらいだけど。どうした？","trans":"────……\n不，就只是去趟便利店而已。怎么了？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901037590040","name":"透","text":"……ううん\r\nじゃ、最後。これが","trans":"……没什么\n那，最后的。这个","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-13","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……？　おー、チョコレートか\r\n俺に？","trans":"……？　哦──，是巧克力啊\n给我的？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901037590050","name":"透","text":"もらってるっしょ、今日。いっぱい\r\nだから","trans":"今天收到了很多吧\n所以","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901037590060","name":"透","text":"最後にして。私で","trans":"最后一个，让我来","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}